<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Infinite Craft Defense — Forge Codex (July 2026)</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel:wght@500;700;900&family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500;600&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  --bg:#12151c; --bg2:#181c26; --panel:#1e2331; --panel2:#242a3b; --line:#323a52;
  --ink:#dfe4f0; --dim:#8b94ad; --faint:#5b6380;
  --ember:#e8913a; --ember2:#f5b56a;
  --fire:#ff7a52; --water:#5db9f0; --earth:#9dbd6a; --wind:#9fb6c9;
  --t0:#7c8598; --t1:#8fb872; --t2:#5db9f0; --t3:#b085e0; --t4:#e8913a; --t5:#ef6a6a; --t6:#f0c95c;
  --radius:10px;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
html,body{height:100%}
body{
  background:var(--bg); color:var(--ink);
  font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',system-ui,sans-serif; font-size:15px; line-height:1.55;
  background-image:
    radial-gradient(1200px 500px at 70% -10%, rgba(232,145,58,.07), transparent 60%),
    radial-gradient(900px 400px at 0% 110%, rgba(93,185,240,.05), transparent 60%);
}
a{color:var(--ember2)}
.wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:26px 20px 80px}

/* ---------- header ---------- */
header{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding-bottom:18px;margin-bottom:18px}
h1{font-family:'Cinzel',serif;font-weight:900;font-size:30px;letter-spacing:.06em;color:var(--ember2)}
h1 .sub{display:block;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.35em;color:var(--dim);font-weight:500;margin-top:2px}
.headstats{margin-left:auto;display:flex;gap:20px;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--dim)}
.headstats b{color:var(--ink);font-size:16px;display:block}

/* ---------- tabs ---------- */
nav{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:22px}
nav button{
  background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--dim);
  padding:9px 16px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;font:inherit;font-weight:600;font-size:13.5px;
  letter-spacing:.02em;transition:all .15s;
}
nav button:hover{color:var(--ink);border-color:var(--ember)}
nav button.on{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#2a2216,#241d13);border-color:var(--ember);color:var(--ember2)}
nav button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ember2);outline-offset:2px}
.tab{display:none}.tab.on{display:block}

/* ---------- common ---------- */
.card{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:18px}
h2{font-family:'Cinzel',serif;font-size:18px;letter-spacing:.05em;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:10px}
h3{font-size:13px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.14em;color:var(--dim);margin:16px 0 8px}
.muted{color:var(--dim);font-size:13.5px}
input[type=text],select{
  background:var(--bg2);border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--ink);border-radius:8px;
  padding:10px 12px;font:inherit;width:100%;
}
input:focus,select:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--ember)}
.row{display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.grow{flex:1 1 260px}

/* element chip */
.chip{
  display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius:999px;padding:5px 13px 5px 8px;cursor:pointer;font-weight:600;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink);
  transition:transform .1s,border-color .15s;user-select:none;
}
.chip:hover{transform:translateY(-1px);border-color:var(--ember)}
.chip .dot{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;flex:none}
.chip.base{border-style:dashed}
.chip.sm{padding:2px 10px 2px 6px;font-size:12.5px}
.tierdot-0{background:var(--t0)}.tierdot-1{background:var(--t1)}.tierdot-2{background:var(--t2)}
.tierdot-3{background:var(--t3)}.tierdot-4{background:var(--t4)}.tierdot-5{background:var(--t5)}
.tierdot-6{background:var(--t6)}.tierdot-x{background:#666;outline:1px dashed #999}

.badge{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:5px;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--dim)}

/* ---------- explorer ---------- */
#grid{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:14px}
.tiergroup{width:100%;margin-top:10px}
.tiergroup .tlabel{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.2em;color:var(--dim);margin-bottom:7px;text-transform:uppercase}
.tiergroup .tchips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}

#detail{margin-top:18px}
.detailhead{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.detailhead .name{font-family:'Cinzel',serif;font-size:26px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.04em}
.formula{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;background:var(--bg2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:12px 14px;margin-top:12px;font-size:15px}
.formula .op{color:var(--ember);font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-weight:600}

/* tree */
.tree{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:13.5px;margin-top:6px}
.tree ul{list-style:none;padding-left:22px;border-left:1px solid var(--line);margin-left:9px}
.tree li{margin:5px 0;position:relative}
.tree li::before{content:'';position:absolute;left:-22px;top:11px;width:16px;height:1px;background:var(--line)}
.tnode{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;cursor:pointer;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:5px}
.tnode:hover{background:var(--panel2)}
.tnode .dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%}
.tnode.baseleaf{color:var(--dim)}
.caret{color:var(--faint);width:12px;display:inline-block;text-align:center}
.assume{color:#c9a44a;font-size:11px;margin-left:6px}

/* ---------- path ---------- */
.steps{counter-reset:s;margin-top:14px}
.step{
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius:8px;padding:10px 14px;margin-bottom:8px;
}
.step::before{
  counter-increment:s;content:counter(s,decimal-leading-zero);
  font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;color:var(--ember);font-size:13px;min-width:26px;
}
.step .eq{color:var(--faint);font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace}
.step .result{font-weight:600}
.pathmeta{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--dim);margin-top:10px}

/* ---------- table ---------- */
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:14px;font-size:14px}
th{
  text-align:left;font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.13em;color:var(--dim);
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:8px 10px;cursor:pointer;user-select:none;white-space:nowrap;
}
th:hover{color:var(--ember2)}
td{padding:7px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #262c3e}
tr:hover td{background:rgba(232,145,58,.04)}
td .lnk{cursor:pointer;font-weight:600}
td .lnk:hover{color:var(--ember2)}

/* ---------- guide ---------- */
.guide p{margin-bottom:10px;max-width:78ch}
.statgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:12px;margin:14px 0}
.stat{background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:12px 14px}
.stat b{font-family:'Cinzel',serif;font-size:22px;color:var(--ember2);display:block}
.stat span{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--dim)}
.bar{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin:5px 0;font-size:13px}
.bar .lbl{width:90px;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;color:var(--dim);text-align:right}
.bar .fill{height:14px;border-radius:3px;min-width:2px}
.bar .n{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;color:var(--dim);font-size:12px}
.note{border-left:3px solid var(--ember);background:rgba(232,145,58,.06);padding:10px 14px;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;margin:12px 0;font-size:13.5px}
.warn{border-left-color:#ef6a6a;background:rgba(239,106,106,.06)}

/* ---------- add ---------- */
.addform{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(180px,1fr));gap:12px;margin-top:12px}
.addform label{font-size:12px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--dim);display:block;margin-bottom:5px}
.btn{
  background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--ember),#c9741f);border:none;color:#1a1206;font:inherit;font-weight:700;
  padding:10px 20px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;letter-spacing:.02em;
}
.btn:hover{filter:brightness(1.08)}
.btn.ghost{background:var(--panel2);color:var(--ink);border:1px solid var(--line)}
#addmsg{margin-top:10px;font-size:13.5px}
.newtag{font-size:10px;background:var(--ember);color:#1a1206;border-radius:4px;padding:1px 6px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.05em;vertical-align:middle}


/* ---------- my stock ---------- */
.chip.have{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#2c2517,#241d13);border-color:var(--ember);color:var(--ember2)}
.chip.have .dot{box-shadow:0 0 6px var(--ember)}
.stockbar{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:12px;align-items:center}
.craftrow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:9px 13px;margin-bottom:7px}
.craftrow .eq{color:var(--faint);font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace}
.craftrow .res{font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}
.craftrow .res:hover{color:var(--ember2)}
.craftrow.oneaway{border-left:3px solid #c9a44a}
.needchip{outline:1px dashed #c9a44a;outline-offset:1px;border-radius:999px}
.craftbtn{margin-left:auto;background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--dim);font:inherit;font-size:12px;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:6px;cursor:pointer}
.craftbtn:hover{border-color:var(--ember);color:var(--ember2)}
.distrow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:13.5px;margin:4px 0}
.distrow .n{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;color:var(--ember);min-width:70px}
.owncount{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--dim)}


.bench{min-height:96px;border:2px dashed var(--line);border-radius:10px;background:var(--bg2);margin-top:12px;padding:14px;transition:border-color .15s,background .15s;position:relative}
.bench.dragover{border-color:var(--ember);background:rgba(232,145,58,.07)}
.benchhint{color:var(--faint);font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:13px;position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;pointer-events:none}
.benchchips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;position:relative;z-index:1}
.bench .chip:hover{border-color:#ef6a6a}
.chip.dragging{opacity:.4}
.chip.inbench{opacity:.35;pointer-events:none}


.qty{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--ember2);margin-left:2px}
.qbtn{background:none;border:none;color:var(--dim);cursor:pointer;font:inherit;font-size:14px;padding:0 3px;line-height:1}
.qbtn:hover{color:var(--ember2)}
.bench .chip{cursor:default}
.bench .chip:hover{border-color:var(--line)}
.needlist{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:12.5px;color:#c9a44a}


.pathwrap{margin-bottom:7px;position:relative}
.pathpanel{display:none;position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:calc(100% + 4px);z-index:40;background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--ember);border-radius:8px;padding:10px 14px 12px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.55)}
.pathwrap.open .pathpanel{display:block}
.pathwrap .distrow{background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:9px 13px;margin:0;cursor:pointer}
.pathwrap .craftrow{margin:0;cursor:pointer}
.ptlegend{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;color:var(--dim);margin-bottom:6px;letter-spacing:.03em}
.pt-have{color:var(--ember2)}
.pt-craft{color:var(--ink)}
.pt-missing{color:#c9a44a}
.pt-missing .ptname{border-bottom:1px dashed #c9a44a}
.pt-locked{color:#ef6a6a}
.pt-locked .ptname{text-decoration:line-through;text-decoration-color:rgba(239,106,106,.6)}
.ptmark{display:inline-block;width:16px;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace}
.chip.locked{border-color:#6e3a3a;color:#b98a8a;background:#251c1e}
.chip.locked .dot{opacity:.4}
.lockmode-on{border-color:#ef6a6a!important;color:#ef9a9a!important}
.starbtn{background:none;border:none;color:var(--dim);cursor:pointer;font-size:15px;padding:0 4px;line-height:1}
.starbtn:hover{color:var(--ember2)}

.pathpanel{max-height:420px;overflow-y:auto}
.ptdivider{border-top:1px solid var(--line);margin:10px 0 8px}
.fw-arrow{color:var(--faint);font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace}
.fw-partner{font-size:12px;color:var(--dim);font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace}
.fw-partner.haveit{color:var(--ember2)}
.fw-more{color:var(--faint);font-size:12px;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-style:italic}


/* focus / allocation */
.focusband{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;background:rgba(232,145,58,.09);border:1px solid var(--ember);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 13px;margin-top:10px;font-size:13.5px}
.focusband .fx{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;color:var(--ember2)}
.rsv{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:10.5px;color:#c9a44a}
.focusbtn{background:none;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;color:var(--dim);cursor:pointer;font:inherit;font-size:12px;padding:3px 10px}
.focusbtn:hover{border-color:var(--ember);color:var(--ember2)}
.focusbtn.on{border-color:var(--ember);color:var(--ember2);background:rgba(232,145,58,.12)}
/* popup navigation */
.ptcrumb{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.ptback{background:none;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;color:var(--dim);cursor:pointer;font:inherit;font-size:12px;padding:2px 9px}
.ptback:hover{border-color:var(--ember);color:var(--ember2)}
.ptroot{font-family:'Cinzel',serif;font-size:14px;color:var(--ember2);letter-spacing:.04em}
.tnode .ptname.navable{cursor:pointer}
.tnode .ptname.navable:hover{text-decoration:underline;color:var(--ember2)}
/* favorites bar */
#favbar{position:fixed;right:14px;top:120px;width:158px;background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:12px;z-index:60;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.4)}
.favtitle{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.22em;color:var(--dim);margin-bottom:8px}
.favitem{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:5px 4px;border-radius:6px;cursor:pointer;font-size:13px}
.favitem:hover{background:var(--panel2)}
.favitem .dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;flex:none}
.favitem .fname{flex:1;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600}
.favstat{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;white-space:nowrap}
.favx{background:none;border:none;color:var(--faint);cursor:pointer;font-size:11px;padding:0 2px;visibility:hidden}
.favitem:hover .favx{visibility:visible}
.favadd{display:flex;gap:4px;margin-top:8px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:8px}
.favadd input{background:var(--bg2);border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--ink);border-radius:6px;padding:4px 8px;font:inherit;font-size:12px;width:100%;min-width:0}
@media(max-width:1520px){
  #favbar{top:auto;bottom:12px;right:12px;left:auto;width:158px}
}
@media(max-width:760px){
  #favbar{position:fixed;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;width:auto;border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:8px 12px;overflow-x:auto}
  .favtitle{margin:0;flex:none}
  #favlist{display:flex;gap:4px}
  .favitem{flex:none}
  .favadd{border:none;padding:0;margin:0;flex:none;width:120px}
  body{padding-bottom:64px}
}


.upmark{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:10.5px;color:var(--dim);margin-left:2px}
.endmark{font-size:10px;color:var(--t6);margin-left:3px}
.endmark.deadend{color:#ef6a6a}


#legendbtn{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--dim);padding:9px 16px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;font:inherit;font-weight:600;font-size:13.5px}
#legendbtn:hover{color:var(--ember2);border-color:var(--ember)}
#legendbtn.on{color:var(--ember2);border-color:var(--ember);background:linear-gradient(180deg,#2a2216,#241d13)}
.leggrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));gap:18px}
.legtitle{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.2em;color:var(--dim);margin-bottom:7px}
.legrow{font-size:13px;color:var(--ink);margin:4px 0;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.legrow .dot{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block}


.afflabel{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.afflabel .dot{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%}
.affshare{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;color:var(--faint);margin-left:3px}
.ltree{font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',sans-serif;margin-top:14px}
.ltree ul{list-style:none;padding-left:24px;border-left:1px solid var(--line);margin-left:10px}
.ltree>ul{border-left:none;padding-left:0;margin-left:0}
.ltree li{margin:6px 0;position:relative}
.ltree li li::before{content:'';position:absolute;left:-24px;top:14px;width:18px;height:1px;background:var(--line)}
.lnodecaret{display:inline-block;width:18px;color:var(--faint);cursor:pointer;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;text-align:center;user-select:none}
.lnodecaret:hover{color:var(--ember2)}
.lnodecaret.leaf{cursor:default;color:transparent}

.qstatus-ok{color:#8fb872}.qstatus-short{color:#c9a44a}.qstatus-blocked{color:#ef6a6a}
.brokenbadge{font-size:10px;background:#3a2626;color:#ef9a9a;border:1px solid #6e3a3a;border-radius:4px;padding:1px 6px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.05em;vertical-align:middle}

@media(max-width:640px){
  h1{font-size:23px}
  .headstats{width:100%;margin-left:0}
}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{transition:none!important;animation:none!important}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
<header>
  <h1>FORGE CODEX<span class="sub">INFINITE CRAFT DEFENSE · RECIPE DASHBOARD · JULY 2026 UPDATE</span></h1>
  <div class="headstats">
    <div><b id="hs-el">–</b>elements</div>
    <div><b id="hs-rec">–</b>recipes</div>
    <div><b id="hs-tier">–</b>max tier</div>
  </div>
</header>

<nav>
  <button data-tab="explore" class="on">Explorer</button>
  <button data-tab="path">Craft Path</button>
  <button data-tab="db">Database</button>
  <button data-tab="stock">My Stock</button>
  <button data-tab="guide">Guide &amp; Stats</button>
  <button data-tab="add">Add Recipe</button>
  <button id="legendbtn" style="margin-left:auto">? Legend</button>
</nav>

<div id="legend" class="card" style="display:none;margin-bottom:18px">
  <div class="leggrid">
    <div class="legsec">
      <div class="legtitle">TIERS &amp; BASES</div>
      <div class="legrow"><span class="dot" style="background:var(--fire)"></span><span class="dot" style="background:var(--water)"></span><span class="dot" style="background:var(--earth)"></span><span class="dot" style="background:var(--wind)"></span> base elements (dashed chip border)</div>
      <div class="legrow"><span class="dot tierdot-1"></span> tier 1 <span class="dot tierdot-2"></span> tier 2 <span class="dot tierdot-3"></span> tier 3 <span class="dot tierdot-4"></span> tier 4 <span class="dot tierdot-5"></span> tier 5</div>
    </div>
    <div class="legsec">
      <div class="legtitle">CHIP MARKERS</div>
      <div class="legrow"><span class="upmark">›3</span> upgradeable — feeds 3 working recipes</div>
      <div class="legrow"><span class="endmark">◆</span> terminal — nothing crafts from it yet</div>
      <div class="legrow"><span class="endmark deadend">◆</span> dead-end — only upgrade uses a broken recipe</div>
      <div class="legrow">🔒 locked (level-gated) · <span class="qty">×4</span> quantity on bench · <span class="rsv">⛶2</span> reserved for focus</div>
      <div class="legrow"><span class="newtag">NEW</span> added this session · <span class="brokenbadge">NOT WORKING</span> recipe broken/unknown</div>
    </div>
    <div class="legsec">
      <div class="legtitle">PATH PREVIEW (hover popups)</div>
      <div class="legrow"><span class="pt-have">✓</span> on bench — consumed from stock</div>
      <div class="legrow"><span class="pt-craft">⚒</span> crafted along the way</div>
      <div class="legrow"><span class="pt-missing">✗</span> need to get · <span class="pt-locked">🔒</span> locked in chain</div>
      <div class="legrow"><span class="fw-arrow">⟶</span> feeds into · <span class="fw-partner">+ partner</span> other ingredient (<span class="fw-partner haveit">✓ if held</span>)</div>
      <div class="legrow">◆ current root · click any name to re-root · ◂ back</div>
    </div>
    <div class="legsec">
      <div class="legtitle">QUEUE &amp; FAVORITES STATUS</div>
      <div class="legrow"><span class="qstatus-ok">✓ buildable · N combines</span> affordable end-to-end</div>
